# Tasks

> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use forge:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.

**Change:** workitem-autorun

**Goal:** Automate Task Center ToDo("已分析") work items through Forge/openspec workflow with progress sub-stages, and update TFS to "已解决" only after archive.

**Architecture:** Add a persisted automation state map, merge it with TFS sync results, show stage/subStage in UI, and drive Forge artifacts via a new orchestrator skill. TFS state updates only after archive.

**Tech Stack:** SolidJS (Task Center UI/store), OpenCode skills, Node CLI tools, TFS integration.

---

